sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant FeedbackGW as Feedback Gateway
    participant FeedbackCtrl as Feedback Controller
    participant ScoreRepo as Score Repository
    participant FeedbackSvc as Feedback Service
    participant RubricSvc as Rubric Service
    participant RubricRepo as Rubric Repository
    participant MessageRepo as Message Repository
    participant TranscriptRepo as Transcript Repository

    User->>FeedbackGW: GET /feedback/scorecards/{id}
    FeedbackGW->>FeedbackCtrl: Forward request

    FeedbackCtrl->>ScoreRepo: Retrieve Scorecard
    alt Scorecard not found
        ScoreRepo-->>FeedbackCtrl: Not found
        FeedbackCtrl-->>User: 404 Scorecard Not Found
    end
    ScoreRepo-->>FeedbackCtrl: Scorecard data

    FeedbackCtrl->>FeedbackSvc: Assemble full details
    FeedbackSvc->>ScoreRepo: Retrieve all ScoreItem records
    ScoreRepo-->>FeedbackSvc: Score items

    loop For each ScoreItem
        FeedbackSvc->>RubricSvc: Get criterion details
        RubricSvc->>RubricRepo: Retrieve Criterion
        RubricRepo-->>RubricSvc: Criterion {label, description}
        RubricSvc-->>FeedbackSvc: Criterion info
    end

    FeedbackSvc->>ScoreRepo: Retrieve all CoachTip records
    ScoreRepo-->>FeedbackSvc: Coach tips

    loop For each CoachTip with excerptRef
        alt Reference is Message
            FeedbackSvc->>MessageRepo: Retrieve referenced content
            MessageRepo-->>FeedbackSvc: Message excerpt
        else Reference is TranscriptSegment
            FeedbackSvc->>TranscriptRepo: Retrieve segment
            TranscriptRepo-->>FeedbackSvc: Transcript excerpt
        end
    end

    Note over FeedbackSvc: Assemble response:<br/>- Summary (score, %)<br/>- Criterion scores<br/>- Coaching tips + excerpts<br/>- Session context

    FeedbackSvc-->>FeedbackCtrl: Complete scorecard
    FeedbackCtrl-->>User: 200 OK<br/>{scorecard, items, tips, context}